        "content_html":  "\u003cblockquote class=\u0027border-l-4 border-amber-600/70 pl-4 py-1 my-4 italic text-stone-300 bg-stone-900/40 rounded-r\u0027\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\n\u003cp class=\u0027mb-4 leading-relaxed text-stone-300 text-base md:text-lg\u0027\u003erönesans resimde perspektifi keşfetti ve bireyi kışkırttı, postmodern dünya ise selfie’yi keşfederek ortada olan nefisleri resmetti.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\u0027mb-4 leading-relaxed text-stone-300 text-base md:text-lg\u0027\u003e— sdmim proje (@sdmimproje) \u003ca href=\"https://twitter.com/sdmimproje/statuses/481455049638699008\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"text-amber-400 hover:text-amber-300 underline underline-offset-2\"\u003e24 Haziran 2014\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\u0027mb-4 leading-relaxed text-stone-300 text-base md:text-lg\u0027\u003e\u003ca href=\"`http://sdmimproje.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/rönesans-postmodernite-birey-nefis.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"text-amber-400 hover:text-amber-300 underline underline-offset-2\"\u003e![`\u003c/a\u003e](http://sdmimproje.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/rönesans-postmodernite-birey-nefis.jpg)\u003c/p\u003e",
        "raw_md":  "\u003e \nrönesans resimde perspektifi keşfetti ve bireyi kışkırttı, postmodern dünya ise selfie’yi keşfederek ortada olan nefisleri resmetti.\n\n— sdmim proje (@sdmimproje) [24 Haziran 2014](https://twitter.com/sdmimproje/statuses/481455049638699008)\n\n[![`](`http://sdmimproje.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/rönesans-postmodernite-birey-nefis.jpg)](http://sdmimproje.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/rönesans-postmodernite-birey-nefis.jpg)"
