        "raw_md":  "[![`](`http://sdmimproje.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/04/tayyip-erdoğan-gökdelen.jpg)](http://sdmimproje.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/04/tayyip-erdoğan-gökdelen.jpg)\n\n[![`](`http://sdmimproje.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/04/hakan-şükür-gökdelen.jpg)](http://sdmimproje.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/04/hakan-şükür-gökdelen.jpg)\n\n**[![`](`http://sdmimproje.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/04/başbakan-gökdelen.jpg)](http://sdmimproje.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/04/başbakan-gökdelen.jpg)**\n\n**[@sdmimproje](https://twitter.com/sdmimproje) : [@hakansukur](http://twitter.com/hakansukur) **Başbakan’ın gökdelen açıklamalarından sonra, gökdelenden ev alıp, bunun sayesinde de bina reklamının yapılması sizce doğru mu?\n\n**  **\n\n**sdmimproje**"
