        "content_html":  "\u003cp class=\u0027mb-4 leading-relaxed text-stone-300 text-base md:text-lg\u0027\u003e\u003ca href=\"`http://sdmimproje.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/12/antoine-de-saint-exupery-prens-kitap-kapak.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"text-amber-400 hover:text-amber-300 underline underline-offset-2\"\u003e![`\u003c/a\u003e](http://sdmimproje.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/12/antoine-de-saint-exupery-prens-kitap-kapak.jpg)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\u0027mb-4 leading-relaxed text-stone-300 text-base md:text-lg\u0027\u003eKüçük Prens- Antoine De Saint-Exupéry\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\u0027mb-4 leading-relaxed text-stone-300 text-base md:text-lg\u0027\u003e\u003cstrong class=\"font-semibold text-stone-100\"\u003esdmimproje\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
