        "category":  "Tefekkür ve Mimarlık",
        "excerpt":  "``http://sdmimproje.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/03/niceligin-egemenligi-ve-cagin-alametleri.jpghttp://sdmimproje.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/03/niceligin-egemenligi-ve-cagin-alametleri.jpg René Guénon – Niceliğin Egemenl...",
        "content_html":  "\u003cp class=\u0027mb-4 leading-relaxed text-stone-300 text-base md:text-lg\u0027\u003e\u003ca href=\"`http://sdmimproje.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/03/niceligin-egemenligi-ve-cagin-alametleri.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"text-amber-400 hover:text-amber-300 underline underline-offset-2\"\u003e![`\u003c/a\u003e](http://sdmimproje.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/03/niceligin-egemenligi-ve-cagin-alametleri.jpg)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\u0027mb-4 leading-relaxed text-stone-300 text-base md:text-lg\u0027\u003eRené Guénon – Niceliğin Egemenliği ve Çağın Alametleri\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\u0027mb-4 leading-relaxed text-stone-300 text-base md:text-lg\u0027\u003e\u003cstrong class=\"font-semibold text-stone-100\"\u003esdmimproje\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
